<title>ITALY: Autostrade to launch 500 bln lire bond.</title>
<headline>Autostrade to launch 500 bln lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's motorway management and construction company Autostrade said in a statement on Tuesday it planned to launch a 500 billion lire five year bond on the Euromarket.</p>
<p>It said the operation would be organised by Chase Manhattan International in London and added that the 1997-2002 bond would be listed on the Luxemburg bourse.</p>
<p>It gave no other financial details but said the bulk of the money would be used to cancel previous debts.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
